# ============================================================================
# Instagram Graph API Configuration
# ============================================================================

# Supabase (ya deberías tenerlo en .env)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-url.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# Instagram Graph API
# Obtén estos valores siguiendo las instrucciones en SETUP.md
INSTAGRAM_BUSINESS_ID=your-instagram-business-account-id
INSTAGRAM_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-instagram-graph-api-access-token

# ============================================================================
# Cómo obtener estos valores:
# ============================================================================

# 1. INSTAGRAM_BUSINESS_ID
#    - Ve a instagram.com/@esteti_kas
#    - Settings → Account type & tools → Switch to professional account
#    - Settings → Apps and websites → Instagram Graph API
#    - Ahí aparecerá tu Business Account ID (número largo)

# 2. INSTAGRAM_ACCESS_TOKEN
#    - Ve a developers.facebook.com
#    - Create app → Business
#    - App Roles → Assign roles to Instagram Account
#    - Tools → Graph API Explorer
#    - Generate access token (INSTAGRAM_MANAGE_INSIGHTS, INSTAGRAM_MANAGE_MESSAGES, etc.)
#    - Usa ese token aquí

# 3. INSTAGRAM_BUSINESS_ID (alternativa)
#    - En Graph API Explorer: GET me/instagram_business_account
#    - Ejecuta y copia el ID del resultado
